# Lovato DMG110.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Lovato DMG110 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: lovato-dmg-modbus-i317.pdf (Doc. I317IGB02_22, 07/02/2022)
# | - Single or 3-phase power analyzer, DIN-rail, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers (FC03); FC04 also accepted.
# | - UINT32/INT32 little-endian (LSW first), word_order = "le".
# | - Protocol address = table hex address − 1 (document states this explicitly).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, configurable baud, 8N1.
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Lovato
@model=DMG110
@vendor_website=lovatoelectric.com
@description=Single/3-phase power analyzer — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/PF, frequency, holding registers (UINT32/INT32 LSW-first).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/lovato-dmg110.toml; Source: lovato-dmg-modbus-i317.pdf (Doc. I317IGB02_22, 07/02/2022). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

